140 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Asbury Park Sheehan Classic was a merge between two classic events, the Asbury Park 5K and the Sheehan Classic, loved by the running community near and far. Dr. George Sheehan was born in Brooklyn in 1918. He was an outstanding track star at Manhattan College, became a cardiologist like his father and married a Jersey girl raising a dozen children together. Dr. Sheehan rediscovered his love for running after many years off. He became a superstar masters runner later in life breaking 5:00 minutes in the mile at the age of 50 years old.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
