142 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Dr. Sheehan was diagnosed with prostate cancer in 1986 and passed away just days before his 75th birthday. Dr. Sheehan had an immense impact on his family and friends. This event is small tribute to honor and remember Dr. George Sheehan and all his contributions to the running community! )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
